	)
	(text "This is the development board for a sensor,\nthat will be used for biomechanical measurements of acceleration and angular velocity (IMU).\nThe magnetometer is added for hopefully improved sensor fusion.\nThe NAND-Flash should allow about 2 hours of recording at ~1600Hz IMU + 100Hz Magnetometer.\n\nThe sensor will be reporting back to a central node (base). \nThe base will be equipped with a SD-Card / more storage\nand will be the middle man communicating back and forth between the sensor and the users device (eg smartphone).\nMost importantly the central node will be synchronizing multiple sensors via its timestamp sent with the BLE-package.\nThats why the current monitor is measuring the current on the 1V8 line of the MCU,\nas it can detect the moment of ble transmit through a current spike.\nThis can then be refered back to and matched with the timestamp sent form the central node. \nThe central node will be serving as a charging case as well."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.114 179.578 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 72 72 72 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4f6decb7-062a-48d1-8fed-6967f586b710")
	)
